<title>CHINA: Ideal Pacific year net rises 11 pct.</title>
<headline>Ideal Pacific year net rises 11 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>     Shr (H.K. cents)	  14.9   vs 14.5</p>
<p>     Dividend (H.K. cents)   5.5    vs 5.0</p>
<p>     Exceptional items	 nil    vs nil</p>
<p>     Net			   67.15  vs 60.46</p>
<p>     Turnover		    573.09 vs 513.70</p>
<p>     Company name		Ideal Pacific Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>     Books close		 Sept 16-24</p>
<p>     Dividend payable	  Oct 28</p>
<p>NOTE - The company is a sea freight transporter.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
